    {
      "id": "e001034",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 690.6985148753242,
      "y": 834.9311876181911,
      "width": 275.548828125,
      "height": 75,
      "text": "• KV Server PutAppend 调 Start\n• 加锁 append 到 logs_\n• 返回 (index, term)\n• ReplicateLoop 负责复制\n• 当未提交命令积攒到一定程度则拒绝新命令写入log",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• KV Server PutAppend 调 Start\n• 加锁 append 到 logs_\n• 返回 (index, term)\n• ReplicateLoop 负责复制\n• 当未提交命令积攒到一定程度则拒绝新命令写入log",
