      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• fenced_: cid → last_seq（被淘汰会话）\n• 迟到重试被拒 kSessionGone → Clerk 旋转 client_id\n• fence_fifo_ 顺序编解码，副本间一致",
