    {
      "id": "th_text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 692,
      "y": 1383,
      "width": 266,
      "height": 128,
      "text": "② 快照限流 ForceSnapshotOnDiskFull\n• CAS 限流：任意 50ms 窗口至多一次真落盘\n  （防 disk_full 并发突发 fsync 风暴）\n• WaitOp 指数退避 2/4/8/16ms 封顶 50ms 重试\n• 锁内编码 + 锁外 rf_->Snapshot",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "② 快照限流 ForceSnapshotOnDiskFull\n• CAS 限流：任意 50ms 窗口至多一次真落盘\n  （防 disk_full 并发突发 fsync 风暴）\n• WaitOp 指数退避 2/4/8/16ms 封顶 50ms 重试\n• 锁内编码 + 锁外 rf_->Snapshot",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
